# Breaking the prologue's loop (game/loop_break.h): spectating, three direction presses. Each is
# a hit: a burst of light round the cycle, the screen flashing towards white and the camera
# jolting, harder each time. Shots straight after each press, while the burst flies out. The
# third breaks it: 1st person, the cycle turning off its route, the bot coming in.
wait 21
press start
press a
press start
wait 4
press left
shot hit1_a
shot hit1_b
shot hit1_c
wait 1
press up
shot hit2_a
shot hit2_b
shot hit2_c
wait 1
press right
shot hit3_a
shot hit3_b
shot hit3_c
wait 1.5
shot broken
